'''Tides''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through [[trading]].

==Appearance ==
The whole knife is bright blue in color like the sea. It has a long, slightly curved blade with three small tidal waves flowing along the side, hence the name. The guard is made up of a triangular sapphire crystal with more tidal waves eroding out from it, which forms the quillons. The handle has four engraved grips and a crystal pommel attached to the bottom of it. Also, the handle is a bit more darker than the blade itself.

==Trivia== 
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/241017568/Mythic-Sword-of-the-Tides Mythic Sword of the Tides].
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [http://www.roblox.com/Tides-item?id=365580583 here].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Tides]], which can be found in the same box.
*This, [[Heat]], and [[Seer]] were used to craft [[Flames]] before the [[Season 1]] update came out on May 25, 2019.
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 55 godly [[Shards|shards]].

